    <mediaPropertyDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[Charleston was the country home of the artists Duncan Grant and Vanessa Bell, and a meeting place for the Bloomsbury Group of writers, artists and intellectuals. Hand-painted walls and furniture survive throughout the rooms.]]></Value>
